  "comment": {
    "text": "Notice on the Data backup, Automatic backup and Restore pages of the portal settings, shown only while private (end-to-end encrypted) rooms are available; on the Restore page it also sits in the warning above the restore confirmation checkbox and in the backups list dialog. Two full sentences telling administrators that a backup carries no encryption keys of private rooms, so the files in those rooms stay unreadable after a restore.",
